        <briefdescription>
<para>Validate the request&apos;s Bearer token, then continue or short-circuit the chain. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Extracts the token and peer IP, checks the &quot;Bearer &quot; prefix, and calls <ref refid="classapi_1_1v2_1_1GateKeeper" kindref="compound">GateKeeper</ref> either synchronously or as a coroutine depending on DatabaseConfig::async. Success stores &quot;clientID&quot;/&quot;clientGroup&quot; on the request and invokes <computeroutput>fccb</computeroutput>; any failure invokes <computeroutput>fcb</computeroutput> with a JSON error response. This override is invoked by Drogon on its IO thread; in async mode the remainder runs on the coroutine frame. <parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername direction="in">req</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Request carrying the Authorization header and peer address. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername direction="inout">fcb</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Filter callback used to send a rejection response (consumed on reject). </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername direction="inout">fccb</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Chain callback invoked on success to run the next filter/handler. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
